{"repositoryId":1414103480,"availability":"available","full":"youssef336/flutter-weekly","name":"flutter-weekly","description":"ملخص أسبوعي بالعربي لجديد قناة Flutter الرسمية على يوتيوب، بيتحدّث لوحده كل يوم بـ Gemini و GitHub Actions.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-11T08:12:44Z","updated":"2026-10-17T11:56:34Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://youssef336.github.io/flutter-weekly/","topics":["arabic","flutter","gemini-api","github-actions","github-pages","javascript","python","youtube"],"demo":"https://youssef336.github.io/flutter-weekly/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:13.782Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:13.782Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:13.782Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T22:41:13.782Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python","Flutter"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-updating Arabic digest of the official Flutter YouTube channel: one summary per video, one recap per week.","English summary. Flutter Weekly is a static site (HTML + CSS + vanilla JS) that follows the official @flutterdev channel. A daily GitHub Actions job runs two standard-library-only Python scripts: one reads the channel's RSS feed, auto-tags each video and merges it into data/videos.json; the other sends every new video to the Gemini API, which watches it from its YouTube URL and writes a junior-friendly Egyptian-Arabic summary (what it's about, 3–5 key points, whether it's worth watching, and a mini glossary), plus a weekly recap. The site, served from GitHub Pages, shows the week's digest…","موقع بسيط بيتابع قناة يوتيوب الرسمية لـ Flutter (@flutterdev) ويلخّصلك الجديد بالعربي المصري، بلغة تناسب حد لسه junior."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/youssef336/flutter-weekly/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d94e9a24711fc2996bca1892497241ea174805ec46a56c17e7535c26b8a54a68","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:13.863Z"},"overviewCheckedAt